_at":"2026-10-06T00:19:22Z"},"body":"- Related: #105876\r\n\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nAddresses a minor regression from the above PR which added a thirdparty include to the core headers which wasn't necessary. `zlib.h` can instead be given the same treatment as `zstd.h`, where the value provided by that header is a hardcoded value with its define/enum equivalent commented out to the side.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\n\r\nWe've seen in #123984 that there's merit to avoiding `static inline` outright, meaning we might want to consider at least a partial revert of their integration. Such a discussion has yet to happen, so this is a minimally-invasive solution in the meantime.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124181/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/124181/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}